容简述：呈现赶车人驾着马车出现在石桥上的场景；声音：持续的雷声\\\",\\n  \\\"[00:00:06-00:00:09] 画面风格：写实古风；主体：石板路、赶车人的脚、马蹄、马车车轮；动作：赶车人、马、马车沿石板路向前行进；镜头变化：从低角度向上缓慢拉远；内容简述：展示马车行进时的脚下石板路细节；声音：持续的雷声，伴随马车行驶的颠簸声\\\",\\n  \\\"[00:00:09-00:00:15] 画面风格：写实古风；主体：古石桥、水面；动作：马车驶离石桥；镜头变化：从石桥下方缓慢拉远；内容简述：展现古石桥的全景，水面形成古桥的对称倒影；声音：马车行驶的颠簸声逐渐消失，古琴声持续至00:00:15\\\"\\n}\",\"render_task_id\":\"54149154572\",\"cover_url\":\"https://p26-sign.douyinpic.com/everphoto-jianying-assets/okoToTa2XCHA7tZfqodeuACHgElaBl0IUEBg7n~tplv-noop.image?dy_q=1792674755\\u0026l=20261022210905927250B7B79E75B58D44\\u0026x-expires=1808226770\\u0026x-signature=YT1n5g1pEvfF%2FNAMAm%2FmL8bOpUY%3D\",\"music_meta\":null,\"preview_url\":\"https://v5-xyq-video.jianying.com/d4cea0685c503c6ff2e4870678e1a2d0/6bc759d2/video/n/everphoto-jianying-assets/7d0b948e75dd4669a9cc82f83d01266e/?a=795647\\u0026ch=0\\u0026cr=0\\u0026dr=0\\u0026cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0\\u0026br=6287\\u0026bt=6287\\u0026cs=0\\u0026ds=3\\u0026ft=TLtriUeR_yygZmo0PIhphgkVQ9w6x\\u0026mime_type=video_mp4\\u0026qs=13\\u0026rc=and4NzNvOmkzZTczNDlmM0Bpand4NzNvOmkzZTczNDlmM0BfYmtuYWFea2FhLS1kNC9zYSNfYmtuYWFea2FhLS1kNC9zcw%3D%3D\\u0026btag=80000e00010000\\u0026dy_q=1792674755\\u0026l=20261022210905927250B7B79E75B58D44\",\"render_task_status\":null,\"draft_key\":null,\"package_id\":null,\"vid\":null,\"render_rsp_map\":{\"disable_edit\":\"1\"},\"download_url\":\"https://v5-xyq-video.jianying.com/be9e887fdc0c076ad5eb0431a09b008f/6bc759d2/video/n/everphoto-jianying-assets/d5aee51312d74276b3706669bfdcabc8/?a=795647\\u0026ch=0\\u0026cr=0\\u0026dr=0\\u0026cd=0%7C0%7C0%7C0\\u0026br=3202\\u0026bt=3202\\u0026cs=0\\u0026ds=3\\u0026ft=TLtriUeR_yygZmo0PIhphgkVQ9w6x\\u0026mime_type=video_mp4\\u0026qs=13\\u0026rc=ajZxNTVvOmQzZTczNDlmM0BpajZxNTVvOmQzZTczNDlmM0AwY3JtYWFua2FhLS1kNC9zYSMwY3JtYWFua2FhLS1kNC9zcw%3D%3D\\u0026btag=80000e00010000\\u0026dy_q=1792674755\\u0026l=20261022210905927250B7B79E75B58D44\\u0026download=true\\u0026filename=v02c76g10004dbd0naq7dld2p2unf33g.mp4\",\"ratio\":null,\"title\":\"\",\"duration\":0,\"